News for every Printer Buddy box: the bell (🔔) on the home page and the News panel.

HOW IT WORKS
  1. Edit relay/news.json (a list, newest first). This file is only the example + help; it is never served.
  2. Commit + push. Cloudflare redeploys the Worker; it serves the list at https://www.printerbuddy.stream/api/news
  3. Boxes check about every 6 hours (and when the page opens). New items show an unread dot on the bell.
  Keep news.json valid JSON (no comments, no trailing commas) or the Worker build fails.

ONE NEWS ITEM, with every option:

  {
    "id": "2026-10-21-v2",
    "date": "2026-10-21",
    "title": "Printer Buddy v2.0 is out 🎉",
    "body": "New dashboard you can rearrange, 20+ new panels, job queue, config editor and more. Please enjoy!",
    "link": "https://github.com/sterling5241/printer-buddy/releases",
    "level": "info"
  }

OPTIONS
  id     required. Unique and never reused: it's how boxes remember what's been read. Tip: date + a short word.
  date   required. YYYY-MM-DD, shown next to the title.
  title  required. One short line.
  body   optional. A few sentences. Plain text (no HTML).
  link   optional. Shows a "Read more →" link (opens in a new tab).
  level  optional, default "info":
           info       a normal news item
           update     a new version / model is available (shown with an update tag)
           important  also shows a slim banner at the top of the page, once per browser, with ✕ to dismiss
                      (use sparingly: e.g. a security fix you want everyone to install)

FULL news.json EXAMPLE (two items, newest first):

  [
    {
      "id": "2026-11-02-fix",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "title": "Please update: share links fix",
      "body": "Fixes share links that stopped loading after 24 hours. Update from the installer menu (option 3).",
      "level": "important"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-21-v2",
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "title": "Printer Buddy v2.0 is out 🎉",
      "body": "New dashboard you can rearrange, 20+ new panels, job queue, config editor and more. Please enjoy!",
      "link": "https://github.com/sterling5241/printer-buddy/releases",
      "level": "info"
    }
  ]

REMOVING AN ITEM: just delete it from news.json. Boxes drop it on their next check.
